# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in the working
# tree, on all platforms, so an edit or checkout on Windows can't flip the
# whole tree to CRLF and bury real diffs under line-ending churn. Binary
# files are auto-detected by text=auto and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must stay LF so they run under bash on every platform
# (Git Bash's cygwin bash chokes on CRLF shebangs). Applies to tools/*.sh.
*.sh text eol=lf
